---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Gavin Daly Developer Resources | GavDaly"
  description="Developer resources, projects, technical notes, and machine-readable links for Gavin Daly."
  markdownUrl="/developer.md"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-10">
    <header class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-sky-950 dark:text-sky-100 md:text-5xl">
        Gavin Daly Developer Resources
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-200">
        Gavin Daly is a software developer based in Canada. This page collects
        his public projects, code, writing, and machine-readable resources.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="developer-resources" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="developer-resources" class="text-2xl font-bold">
        Projects and code by Gavin Daly
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-lg leading-8">
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/gavdaly">Gavin Daly on GitHub</a> —
          profile and public repositories.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/gavdaly/gavdaly">
            GavDaly source on GitHub
          </a>
          — source code for this website.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/projects">Gavin Daly projects</a> — software,
          infrastructure, home-lab, and network work.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="writing-resources" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="writing-resources" class="text-2xl font-bold">
        Writing and technical reference
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-lg leading-8">
        <li>
          <a href="/notes">Gavin Daly technical notes</a> — practical notes on
          software, infrastructure, privacy, and security.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/posts">Gavin Daly posts</a> — longer writing about
          development and the tools behind it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/about">About Gavin Daly</a> — background, interests, and
          approach to building software.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="machine-resources" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="machine-resources" class="text-2xl font-bold">
        Machine-readable Gavin Daly resources
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-lg leading-8">
        <li>
          <a href="/llms.txt">Gavin Daly LLM index</a> — this developer-resource
          index for agents and language models.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/index.md">Gavin Daly Markdown index</a> — machine-readable
          site introduction.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/.well-known/ard.json">GavDaly ARD manifest</a> — Agentic
          Resource Discovery metadata.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">Gavin Daly security contact</a> —
          security.txt and policy location.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/.well-known/nostr.json">Gavin Daly Nostr identity</a> —
          public identity mapping.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="api-status" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="api-status" class="text-2xl font-bold">
        Gavin Daly API and SDK status
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-8">
        Gavin Daly does not currently publish a supported public API, OpenAPI
        specification, SDK, or MCP server. The resources on this page are the
        current public developer surface.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
